Rākṣasas report Kumbhakarṇa slain by Rāma --- Rāvaṇa faints hearing brother slain as kin wail --- Rāvaṇa mourns lost right arm fearless slayer of gods --- Rāvaṇa fears gods rejoice monkeys storm Laṅkā gates --- Rāvaṇa says kingdom and Sītā vain without Kumbhakarṇa --- Rāvaṇa vows to follow brother or kill his slayer --- Rāvaṇa recalls spurned Vibhīṣaṇa counsel and blames own deed